  "prefLabel": "Mavs 204.03 Contested Cases",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mavs 204.03 Contested Cases. In the event a complaint petition is considered a contested case which cannot be settled under Mavs 204.02, and a hearing is scheduled, all parties shall be notified of the:\n\n(a) Time, place, and nature of the hearing;\n\n(b) Statutory authority under which the hearing is to be held;\n\n(c) Particular sections of the statutes or rules involved;\n\n(d) Issues involved;\n\n(e) Right to have an attorney present to represent the party at the party’s expense; and\n\n(f) Right to have the department provide a certified shorthand court reporter at the party’s expense.\n\nSource. #13459-A, eff 10-14-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mavs200.html"
